    "causal_summary": "Routes a request to the right subsystem of a portable CLI projection package that rewrites terse agent output into readable plain English across six runtimes, while leaving the canonical event stream, transcript, tool data and model context byte-for-byte unchanged, and returning the exact original on every unsafe or failed path. Projection is off by default and the skill is held off advisor routing, so an operator opts in and invokes it by hand.",
